@startuml AskMyData_System_Context

title AskMyData — System Context

left to right direction

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User
actor Administrator

rectangle "AskMyData\n(Modular Monolith)" as AskMyData

database "Application Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as AppDB

database "External Data Source\n(PostgreSQL)" as DataSource

cloud "LLM Provider" as LLM

cloud "Email Service" as Email

User --> AskMyData : Authenticate\nManage projects\nExplore data

Administrator --> AskMyData : Manage platform access\n(Production-ready)

AskMyData --> AppDB : Store application data

AskMyData --> DataSource : Schema discovery\nRead-only SQL queries

AskMyData --> LLM : Question processing\nSemantic metadata generation

AskMyData --> Email : Send invitations\n(Production-ready)

note bottom of AppDB
Stores AskMyData data:
- users
- projects
- catalogs
- conversations
- question runs
- execution traces
end note

note bottom of DataSource
Business database explored
by the AI engine.

Read-only access.
end note

note bottom of LLM
Provider-independent interface.

(OpenAI, Azure OpenAI,
Anthropic, Ollama...)
end note

@enduml